  data: {
    LLM: "1. Standard trick-taking. Must follow suit (if suits are used) or rank.\n2. In Krypkille, the player with the *HIGHEST* card wins the trick (and thus 'penalty' cards).\n3. **The Harlekin**: Changes value. If led, it is the highest. If played later, it is the lowest.",
    Player: "1. Standard trick-taking. Must follow suit (if suits are used) or rank.\n2. In Krypkille, the player with the *HIGHEST* card wins the trick (and thus 'penalty' cards).\n3. **The Harlekin**: Changes value. If led, it is the highest. If played later, it is the lowest.",
    objective: "Score as few points as possible by avoiding capturing tricks or holding 'lowest' cards.",
    gameplay: "1. Standard trick-taking. Must follow suit (if suits are used) or rank.\n2. In Krypkille, the player with the *HIGHEST* card wins the trick (and thus 'penalty' cards).\n3. **The Harlekin**: Changes value. If led, it is the highest. If played later, it is the lowest.",
