      'Two of each card in the 42-card deck',
      'Harlekin is highest when led, lowest when played second',
      "Hus (Home) blocks exchanges - 'Home stays'",
      'Kuku (Cuckoo) penalty when received',
      'Avoid winning tricks to avoid penalty points',
